    "text": "By The Weather Authority App ,\n3 hours ago INDEPENDENCE, Ky. (WKRC) - There is nothing that can be done now to save 24-year-old Heaven Glisson or her friend Daylon Bradford after they were gunned down on September 21. But Glisson's father, and a Northern Kentucky lawmaker, say there are things that could have been done before they were killed and Donald Bryant turned the gun on himself. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
